  "prefLabel": "Puc 101.09 Person",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 101.09 “Person” means any individual, partnership, corporation, association, governmental subdivision, or public or private organization of any character which appears before the commission for any purpose.\n\nSource. #6470, eff 3-18-97; ss by #8656, eff 6-10-06; ss by #14185, eff 1-24-25 (formerly Puc 102.11)",
